WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:03.160
A thrill was born that day...

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:06.070
Ever since that day...

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.030
...the world began to change!

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:15.490
Hm... What about this?

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.910
I'm not really feeling it.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:20.910
What do you want to do?

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:23.420
Let's try another store.

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:24.660
Sure!

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.920
Remember that plushie
I wasn't able to get last time?

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.600
I looked online, and it was in an auction...

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.850
Ayumu, why don't you get this?

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.600
It'll look great on you.

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:44.690
I-It's okay. I mean, it's cute,
but it's super childish.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:48.400
You think so? You were wearing
stuff like this up until recently.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:50.860
You're talking about when
we were in grade school, right?

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.860
I'm over those now.

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:58.490
Just wear whatever you want.
You look super cute in whatever you wear.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:01.200
--There you go, saying stuff like that again.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.490
--Hey, look!

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:06.290
Didn't you wear something
like this in kindergarten?

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.130
Wow, this takes me back.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.640
I'm Ayu-bun, bun.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:15.250
You were so adorable.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:17.130
Say...

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:19.640
Do the thing.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:20.640
What thing?

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:22.450
Ayu-bun.

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:25.250
Huh?

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.440
Like I'd actually do that, jeez!

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:29.570
Aw...

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:32.740
I'm starting to get hungry.
Why don't we go downstairs?

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:34.280
Agreed, bun!

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:36.650
Yu-bun sounds way cuter.

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:38.660
You're wrong, bun.

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:41.430
So, what should we eat?

00:01:41.790 --> 00:01:43.540
I'm feeling buns.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:44.750
You read my mind.

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:46.750
Oh, yeah.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.380
So during second period today...
Hey, what flavor is that?

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:53.880
Wanna bite? It's the limited-edition
lemon salt custard.

00:01:54.130 --> 00:01:55.090
Sure.

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.090
Okay. Say, "Ah."

00:01:57.930 --> 00:01:59.260
Ooh, yum!

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:00.720
That is good!

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.810
You got some on your face.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:05.270
Wanna try mine?

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:06.850
Oh, I know.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.340
Hey, move in closer.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:13.820
Ah...

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:21.030
What should we do after this?

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:22.450
Hm...

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.450
Wanna catch a movie?

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.330
Nothing interesting seems to be out right now.

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:30.160
I guess we could just
watch whatever like usual--

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.720
Is there some kind of event going on?

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.380
Setsuna-chan!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.220
You've got this!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:42.260
Setsuna-chan!

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:45.470
Wait, is it just Setsuna-chan?

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.280
Weren't they supposed to
debut a new group today?

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:56.360
Your emotions that take off running
will make you stronger!

00:02:56.360 --> 00:03:03.370
When I don't know what to do,
I'll just hold your hand

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:24.100
I already said bye-bye to the past I spent

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:27.520
Almost betraying my precious feelings

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:30.520
I kept repeating risks and regrets

00:03:30.600 --> 00:03:32.510
Sounds like something exciting's going on.

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.480
Let's go check it out!

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.530
Yeah!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:49.460
Whenever we close our eyes,
we can meet as many times as we'd like

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:54.840
My heart beats faster and
the future I believe in is right here

00:03:54.840 --> 00:04:00.840
The moment that the world shines
with brilliant colors

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:06.770
I want to see that with you,
those feelings are my answer

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:13.940
Your emotions that take off running
will make you stronger!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:19.570
When I don't know what to do,
I'll just hold your hand

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:25.160
You don't need to hold back on
the person you truly want to be

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:30.750
See? Your dreams will start shining someday!

00:04:30.750 --> 00:04:36.550
Your emotions that leapt out aren't a lie!

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:42.180
Even the hope born from tears

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:47.810
Will connect with a strength
that your eyes cannot see

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:53.810
See? Your dreams will start shining someday!

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:14.000
That was awesome!

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:20.380
You're so cute!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:24.680
That was so good!

00:05:24.680 --> 00:05:26.140
Notice me!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.640
Wow...

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.390
Yeah...

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.730
Right? That was awesome, right?!

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.400
Y-Yeah...

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:40.400
She was so cool! So cute! That was insane!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.650
I've never seen someone like her!

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:45.280
What is this feeling? It's so thrilling!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.150
Who was she?

00:05:47.780 --> 00:05:49.530
Hey, look! A poster!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:51.780
There she is.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.890
Nijigasaki... School Idol Club?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:05:59.610
Wait, Nijigasaki...

00:06:00.210 --> 00:06:02.780
That's our school!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.340
Morning.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:48.510
Not enough sleep?

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.680
Sorta.

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.220
Don't be late.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.430
I won't.

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.100
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.270
Let's go.

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.440
Okay.

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:14.040
We're going to have another quiz next week,

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:17.050
so make sure you review this part.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.820
That's all for today.

00:07:29.720 --> 00:07:30.910
Ayumu!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:33.140
Were you waiting long?

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:34.850
Nah, let's go home.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.390
Before we do that,

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:39.220
there's somewhere I wanted
to stop by. Do you mind?

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:41.850
Sure, let's go.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:42.930
Thanks!

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:49.500
Huh? W-Wait!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.910
Hey, where are we going?

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.870
The School Idol Club!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.160
Say, Yu-chan...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:02.620
I'm not...

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:07.630
I really had no idea about school idols.

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:11.860
When I went home yesterday,
I watched a ton of videos.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:17.640
They were all so cool and cute...

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.250
They were all shining.

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:23.520
They just grabbed my heart, you know?

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.190
But the one I'm really interested in
right now is the girl from yesterday.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.150
Her name is Setsuna Yuki-chan.

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:30.030
"<i>Chan</i>"?!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.530
I guess she's pretty famous.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:36.120
Apparently, she's the mysterious
and elusive school idol from Niji High!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.080
I wonder if she has a fan club.

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.660
If she has her next performance
lined up, I totally wanna go!

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.580
B-But we're already second-years!

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:45.790
We're going to go to
prep school together, remember?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.840
We don't have any time for
chasing after school idols...

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:51.680
That's not a problem. Actually, it's perfect!

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:55.850
When I listened to Setsuna-chan's songs
while studying, I totally made progress!

00:08:55.850 --> 00:08:58.110
I totally aced our quiz today, too!

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:02.230
I just feel super motivated, you know?

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.310
I've never felt anything like this!

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:12.030
First, I need to get her autograph!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.740
Let's go, Ayumu!

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:14.820
Wait!

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:21.040
So this is where all the club rooms are.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.500
Come to think of it, we've never been here.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:24.830
It's huge!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:30.420
Hey, where's the School Idol Club room?

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.380
I dunno.

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:37.850
No one's updated the homepage in a while,
and it wasn't listed in the directory.

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.390
Then how were you...?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.560
I just figured we'd stop by every room and ask.

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.770
Really?

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.730
Don't worry. We'll find it in no time!

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.650
Oh, for crying out loud...

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:51.150
Excuse me...

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:55.400
Welcome to the Nagashi Somen Club!
Did you want to join?

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:59.280
No, we were just looking for
the School Idol Club...

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:01.240
Haven't heard of it.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.210
That looks really good...

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:05.830
Please excuse us.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:18.430
We're not finding it at all...

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:21.050
Well, this school has
a ton of clubs and students.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:24.520
Apparently there are over a hundred clubs.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:25.450
Seriously?

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:29.560
Um, excuse me...

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.530
Have you heard of the School Idol Club?

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:36.110
Do you know where it is?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.750
Maybe she's in a hurry...

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.050
Sup, Rinari?

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:53.580
Ai-san...

00:10:55.720 --> 00:10:59.260
Here. The School Idol Club is right here.

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:02.140
No one seemed to know where it was...

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:05.480
Well, the club was just created this year.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.390
Thanks. You're a lifesaver.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.620
No probs.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.400
I wasn't...

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.150
I wasn't in a hurry...

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:17.350
You just scared me a little.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.530
I see. I'm glad you weren't in a hurry.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:24.280
Do you like school idols?

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:28.670
Huh? Yeah! I just got into them, but...

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:29.750
I see.

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:31.830
You, too?

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:38.550
Y-Yeah, maybe? I'm not really sure yet.

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:39.780
I see...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:43.050
Thanks. I'll go check out the club.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:44.930
Let's go, Ayumu!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.770
S-Sure...

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:49.810
So this is...

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:54.220
The Nijigasaki School Idol Club!

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:55.680
Say, Yu...

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.470
What are you doing here?

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:02.820
General curriculum second-years,
Yu Takasaki-san and Ayumu Uehara-san.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.850
I'm sorry... Have we met before?

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:12.080
Well, I am the student council president.
Of course, I know everyone's names.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.580
Huh? The student council president?!

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:18.710
My name is Nana Nakagawa.

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:23.170
Come to think of it, I guess I've seen you
at the school assemblies before...

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:27.140
Did you need something from this club?

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.350
Yeah! I came to see Setsuna Yuki-chan!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:34.030
She won't be coming here anymore.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.230
Apparently, she quit being a school idol.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.220
It's not just her.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:45.240
This School Idol Club...

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:50.870
...has been disbanded as of this moment.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:51.740
What?!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.170
If you'll excuse me.

00:12:56.710 --> 00:12:58.300
No...

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.430
I'm sure tomorrow will be just the same...

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:13.230
There will never be happiness, but...

00:13:13.230 --> 00:13:15.190
Okay, that's good.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:18.320
Let's finish off with ten laps around the track.

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.440
Quit whining and get going!

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.940
Shizuku, I heard what happened
to your other club.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.740
Now that you aren't juggling two clubs,

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.340
you'll be able to concentrate
on just the Drama Club, right?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.710
Zzz... Zzz...

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:39.500
Crap...

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:44.980
It's already evening. I have to hurry up,
or Setsuna-chan will...

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.630
Oh... I guess she won't yell at me anymore.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:56.650
You seem down, Emma.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:59.440
Karin-chan. Don't you have your modeling job?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.070
I'm off today.

00:14:01.280 --> 00:14:02.530
I see...

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.070
What are you going to do
about being a school idol?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.790
I've been trying to talk to Setsuna-chan
since she's our president,

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.540
but I haven't been able to get a hold of her.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.540
The club was just supposed to
go on a short break...

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.290
But now it's being disbanded?

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.520
Don't make that face.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.180
Is there anything I can help with?

00:14:40.570 --> 00:14:44.040
I'm not going to give up!

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:47.320
Ayumu, what flavor is that?

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.740
The limited-edition
raclette cheese and honey flavor.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:51.950
Wanna bite?

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:52.710
Sure do.

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.390
Then let's go halfsies.

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.080
Here you go.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.080
It's really good.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.410
It's too bad.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:07.310
About Setsuna-san.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.720
Well, she should be at the school somewhere,
so I'm sure we'll see her...

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:15.470
Let's just forget that. I'm sure
she had her reasons for quitting.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:20.580
I wonder if it's that hard...

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:23.890
...to chase your dreams.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.810
That's what it means to be an idol, right?

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.250
I mean, I don't have any dreams
of my own yet, but...

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:38.370
If I could support someone
chasing their dreams...

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:42.250
Something would finally start for me, too.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:46.010
Or at least, that's what I thought.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:52.030
Just kidding!

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.290
Let's stop by Odaiba on our way home.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:12.280
What do you think?

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.530
I think it's fine.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.280
Ooh, it's super cheap.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:26.970
What should I do about that shirt?

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:29.300
Let's look at it again tomorrow.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:30.090
You sure?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.180
Yeah.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.470
Thanks.

00:16:36.970 --> 00:16:39.100
Oh, by the way.

00:16:39.140 --> 00:16:41.140
Tomorrow's math class...

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.100
Ayumu?

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:48.780
Let's start...

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:52.150
Let's start this together, Yu-chan!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:58.170
I watched some videos, too...

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:04.750
School idol videos. Not just
of Setsuna-san.

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:06.130
I watched a lot.

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.750
I thought they were really amazing.

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:13.800
They were able to all express
their feelings so clearly.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:18.260
School idols are so amazing!

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:22.890
I thought it'd be amazing
if I could be like that, too...

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:24.760
Ayumu...

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.770
I'm sorry I couldn't
actually say this at first...

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:32.030
But I wanted to meet Setsuna-san, too!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.570
But if we did meet her,

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:38.540
I felt like I'd just get
too emotional, so I got scared.

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:44.540
But once we've started moving, we can't stop.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.040
We can't hold back.

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:56.320
I love them!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:07.600
I still love pink and cute clothes,

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:09.480
and I still want to wear them!

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:20.250
I want to be honest with myself.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:25.250
So... I want you to watch me.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:32.920
I...

00:18:34.300 --> 00:18:37.050
...want to become a school idol!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:48.060
We can fly into the dreaming sky

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.650
Because we're not alone

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:56.030
I think that we can go as far as we want

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:59.320
Beyond the sky

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:06.460
Strongly wishing right now

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:14.300
Higher, higher, see?

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:20.720
I always kept this hidden
deep within my heart

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:28.440
And ignored these feelings
that started to bloom

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:34.780
I just couldn't find my confidence
and kept my head down

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:42.030
But you were the one who gave me
a gentle push forward

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:48.750
The warmth from holding your hand

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:56.920
Gave me enough courage to fill my heart

00:19:56.920 --> 00:20:00.430
Now, let's walk the dreaming way

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:03.970
It continues on into the future

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:11.060
The light beaming from our dreams
that have only just begun

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:14.520
It's so thrilling, dreaming light

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:18.110
Words just aren't enough

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:20.700
So I'll put them into a song

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:30.330
I hope the beating of my heart reaches you

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:10.780
I still don't have enough courage
or confidence right now...

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:16.110
This is the best I can do...

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:22.890
But will you see this dream through with me?

00:21:34.730 --> 00:21:35.640
Of course, I will!

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:40.370
I'll always be by your side, Ayumu!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.410
Okay!

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:07.010
<i>As we slowly run down this path</i>

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:10.890
<i>Something is trying to come to life</i>

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:17.730
<i>I want to tell you, I want to tell you that</i>

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:20.530
<i>The sky that we look up at every day</i>

00:22:20.530 --> 00:22:24.490
<i>Has a blue that changes with the seasons</i>

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:31.120
<i>There are no rules, it's telling us</i>
<i>to depict it however we please</i>

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:33.410
<i>Let's not be in a hurry!</i>

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:37.880
<i>Let's enjoy this thrilling time even more!</i>

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:45.970
<i>Let's all pursue the things that we love</i>

00:22:46.890 --> 00:22:50.350
<i>We don't know where we're headed to just yet</i>

00:22:50.350 --> 00:22:53.430
<i>Hopefully, there's an exciting</i>
<i>future awaiting us</i>

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:57.940
<i>It'd make me happy</i>
<i>if we can both smile about that</i>

00:22:57.940 --> 00:23:00.570
<i>Thank you again today</i>

00:23:00.570 --> 00:23:03.820
<i>Now, let us open up our very own maps</i>

00:23:03.820 --> 00:23:06.990
<i>And casually take flight</i>

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:12.290
<i>I want to dream, aspire, and dream once again</i>

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:16.500
<i>I just want to keep dreaming!</i>

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:33.680
Curse you, student council!

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:38.880
Next time, "Cutest Girl."
